them, bar and all, and put them upon his shoulders, and carried them up to the top of an hill that is before Hebron.',null,'{"map": {"view": "land", "kind": "locate", "markers": [{"lat": 32.5853, "lon": 35.1844, "label": "A"}, {"lat": 31.504, "lon": 34.4644, "label": "B"}, {"lat": 33.249, "lon": 35.652, "label": "C"}, {"lat": 31.8717, "lon": 35.4446, "label": "D"}]}}'::jsonb) on conflict (id) do nothing;
